<%- include('partials/header',{title:'Log in',active:'login'}) %>
<div class="login-layout"><section class="login-intro"><div class="hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="eyebrow">ONE CAMPUS. ENDLESS POSSIBILITIES.</p><h1 class="split-heading"><span>Less coordination.</span><span>More <em>connection.</em></span></h1><p class="lead-copy">The space between an idea and a great campus event? A little less paperwork. A lot more possibility.</p><div class="intro-list"><div><span>01</span><p><strong>Plan with confidence.</strong>Clear venues. Conflict-free time slots.</p></div><div><span>02</span><p><strong>Keep everyone connected.</strong>One place for events and registrations.</p></div><div><span>03</span><p><strong>Learn by doing.</strong>Explore OS scheduling and real relational data.</p></div></div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>BUILT FOR CAMPUS LIFE</span><span class="hero-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></section><section class="login-card"><div class="login-card-top"><span class="login-lock"><%- include('partials/icon',{name:'lock'}) %></span><span class="small-note">A secure place to begin.</span></div><p class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO CAMPUSFLOW</p><h2>Make yourself<br>at home.</h2><p class="muted">Log in with your administrator or student account.</p><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<%= csrf %>"><div class="mb-4"><label class="form-label" for="identifier">Email or student ID</label><input class="form-control" id="identifier" name="identifier" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="username" spellcheck="false" value="<%= identifier || 'admin@campus.test' %>" placeholder="you@university.edu"></div><div class="mb-4"><label class="form-label" for="password">Password</label><div class="password-field"><input class="form-control" id="password" name="password" type="password" required maxlength="256" autocomplete="current-password" value="CampusAdmin@2026"><button type="button" class="password-toggle" hidden data-enhance aria-label="Show password" aria-pressed="false"><%- include('partials/icon',{name:'eye'}) %></button></div></div><button class="btn btn-primary w-100">Log in <%- include('partials/icon',{name:'arrow'}) %></button></form></section></div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>